## Why This Is Asked
This evaluates expertise in designing tenant-isolated logging architectures—a critical security requirement in multi-tenant SaaS platforms where log exposure can lead to data breaches.

## Key Concepts
- Cloud Logging Router with tenant-specific sinks using label-based filtering
- IAM Conditions implementing least-privilege access controls
- Data Loss Prevention API for automatic PII redaction
- CI/CD pipeline integration with synthetic tenant provisioning
- Automated rollback mechanisms for isolation verification

